00:04:32.138 --> 00:04:36.042 line:0%
CAMPAIGN CAN GET OUT ITS VOTERS

00:04:33.373 --> 00:04:38.144 line:0%
TO THE POLLS THROUGH THE EARLY

00:04:36.209 --> 00:04:40.980 line:0%
