00:05:47.513 --> 00:05:48.614 line:0%
--

00:05:48.214 --> 00:05:50.450 line:0%
&gt;&gt; PLENTY OF BOTH.

00:05:49.015 --> 00:05:51.184 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THIS IS WHAT MCCONNELL WAS

00:05:50.616 --> 00:05:52.385 line:0%
