00:06:08.601 --> 00:06:11.304 line:0%
NEED TO LEARN.

00:06:10.002 --> 00:06:13.139 line:0%
THE LAST FIVE YEARS, WHENEVER

00:06:11.471 --> 00:06:14.374 line:0%
YOU THINK ABOUT DONALD TRUMP'S

00:06:13.306 --> 00:06:16.142 line:0%
POLICIES, THE LAST FIVE YEARS,

