WE CERTAINLY WOULD LIKE, AS

00:06:52.979 --> 00:06:55.047 line:0%
CAMPAIGN REPORTERS, WE WOULD

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:57.784 line:0%
LIKE TO START COVERING THESE

00:06:55.214 --> 00:06:58.951 line:0%
RACES AT A WARM CLIMATE LIKE

